atlas command
# Reconciled by sync-command-organs.mjs from real disk state -- one
# organ per Bonfyre command. Existing authored law is retained on sync.
# maturity: measured (ships selftest/tests), implemented (built + responds
# to --help), declared (source-only). source_path is real; witness is the
# smoke harness for live commands. `bun architecture/sync-command-organs.mjs
# --check` fails if a current Bonfyre command directory has no Atlas organ.

architecture cmd-a-p-i
  canonical_name BonfyreAPI
  family command
  domain Command / API
  semantic_question What does the BonfyreAPI capability organ realize, and by what contract?
  purpose Command-surface organ realizing the APICapability capability. A first-class Bonfyre capability, advertised and composable, not a script.
  maturity measured
  command BonfyreAPI
  internal_calculus bonfyre-api binary
  forbidden_inference the command exists -> its effect is authorized (read-only, but scope still applies)
  source_path cmd/BonfyreAPI/src/main.c
  witness packs/no-simulation/command-evidence-20261010.tsv
  witness cmd/BonfyreAPI/tests/vectors/command_behavior.json + packs/no-simulation/command-behavior-20261029.tsv: behavior vectors on small real fixtures in fresh temp dirs, replayed by make -C tests/vectors check (2026-10-29): command.api=pass
  source_lineage the 91-command capability surface
  known_gap operator command.api quality-proven on a real input in the command workload of 2026-10-10 (receipt rcpt-ebaefc1b894aec4c46f5), one run on one input; realizes APICapability; deeper development toward the BonfyreFS level (WiringSpec consumes/produces, full contract) is ongoing

architecture cmd-admission
  canonical_name BonfyreAdmission
  family command
  domain Command / Admission
  semantic_question What does the BonfyreAdmission capability organ realize, and by what contract?
  purpose The one ledger every heavy local claim asks before it takes bytes. Disk volumes keep the archived resource_admission.py semantics; the memory volume is unified RAM, asked by bonfyre-moe serve before a model becomes resident, by llama-cli runs and the Clef decision runtime before they load, and by the hourly estate publish pass before it composes.
  maturity measured
  command BonfyreAdmission
  internal_calculus estimate x (free or available memory) x protected floor x open unsettled grants -> admit | defer | reject, recorded on resource_grants
  forbidden_inference the command exists -> its effect is authorized (read-only, but scope still applies)
  forbidden_inference an admitted memory grant -> the load will succeed or the machine stays responsive; it is a claim against a measured reading, not a reservation the kernel enforces
  forbidden_inference a defer on the memory volume -> the request is wrong; free memory moves when any program exits, so memory never answers reject except above physical RAM
  source_path cmd/BonfyreAdmission/src/main.c
  source_path engine/core/src/admission.c
  source_path engine/core/include/bf_admission.h
  witness cmd/BonfyreAdmission/tests/smoke.sh checks disk floors, the bare-0 refusal, memory defer versus reject, and the live memory reading
  witness engine/core/tests/admission_test.c checks verdict parity on disk volumes, memory grant settlement, memory defer, and plane release after a crash
  witness packs/no-simulation/model-residency-20261016/residency.json records the live loads, refusal and clean release on this Mac
  invariant a memory grant is settled once its process is resident: it stays held by its plane and stops counting as committed, so loaded bytes are not subtracted twice
  invariant a restarted owner releases every open grant its plane left behind before it asks again
  invariant under critical memory pressure (kern.memorystatus_vm_pressure_level 4) available memory reads 0
  source_lineage the 91-command capability surface
  known_gap memory available is free + inactive + speculative + purgeable pages; compressor and swap headroom are not modelled beyond the critical-pressure cutoff
  known_gap Linux reads MemAvailable; only macOS was exercised

