  forbidden_inference installed through a local tap from a local tarball -> a published package; no tagged release carries these build targets, the formula is in no public tap, and the MacPorts recipe has never run because MacPorts is not installed here
  known_gap the standalone unit is the compiler binary alone; its donor-application tests need the Frappe trees beside it and are not part of the package's own check

