  invariant GET /health and GET /bonfyre/residency answer without loading; every other route is relayed byte for byte to llama-server
  invariant a denied local load identifies resource_unavailable for memory or admission failure, model_unsupported after a chat GGUF cannot become healthy under the local server, or local_backend_unavailable when the server cannot start; only a transient resource deferral carries Retry-After
  forbidden_inference a 200 from /health -> a model is resident; it means the front can load one on demand
  forbidden_inference the endpoint answered -> the first-choice checkpoint answered; the response names the model, and a fallback may have loaded
