  purpose Native explicit delivery-right and TransportLease owner. It binds a current Auth ActorClosure, current MediaLibrary direct plan and an explicit protocol/time-scoped right to a bounded HLS/DASH/MOQT eligibility lease; right or lease revocation is an owner-state transition that future carrier requests must recheck.
  maturity measured
  command BonfyreMediaDelivery
  internal_calculus Auth ActorClosure x direct PlaybackPlan x explicit right interval -> TransportLease | refusal
  forbidden_inference a command-issued lease -> bytes delivered, a carrier session, transcode, media ownership, a watch occurrence or authority beyond its explicit scope
