  witness cmd/BonfyreVec/tests/vectors/command_behavior.json + packs/no-simulation/command-behavior-20261029.tsv: behavior vectors on small real fixtures in fresh temp dirs, replayed by make -C tests/vectors check (2026-10-29): command.vec=pass
