  invariant estate-audit reports the source lake beside the axes: source roots read and those with a QID, open IDENTITY gaps, retained items whose source a composed subject reads, and subjects with a site, a reader, or both; the estate's own territories read everything and are not counted as subjects
  invariant lake-check prints one FAIL or NOTE line per lake regression in the live sweep's format: addressed publishers without a bundle or reader, admitted sources without a reader, or a coverage count below the last clean floor; the floor is raised only by a cut with no FAIL and is never lowered
